{title: Praise to the Lord, the Almighty}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]Praise to the [**]Lord the Al[Em]mighty, the [F]King of cre[G]a[C]tion
[C]O my soul, [**]praise Him for [Em]He is thy [F]health and sal[G]va[C]tion
[C]All ye who [F]hear, [C]now to His [F]temple draw [G]near
[G]Join me in [Am]glad ado[F]ra[C]tion
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Praise to the [**]Lord who o'er [Em]all things so [F]wondrously [G]reign[C]ing
[C]Bears thee on [**]eagle's Wings, [Em]e'er in his [F]keeping main[G]tain[C]ing
[C]God's care en[F]folds [C]all whose true [F]good he up[G]holds
[G]Has thou not [Am]known his sus[F]tain[C]ing
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]Praise to the [**]Lord who doth [Em]prosper thy [F]work and de[G]fend [C]thee
[C]Surely His [**]goodness and [Em]mercy here [F]daily at[G]tend [C]thee
[C]Ponder a[F]new [C]what the Al[F]mighty can [G]do
[G]Who with His [Am]love doth be[F]friend [C]thee
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]Praise to the [**]Lord who doth [Em]nourish thy [F]life and re[G]store [C]thee
[C]Fitting thee [**]well for the [Em]tasks that are [F]ever be[G]fore [C]thee
[C]Then to thy [F]need [C]God as a [F]mother doth [G]speed
[G]Spreading the [Am]wings of grace [F]o'er [C]thee!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
[C]Praise to the [**]Lord o let [Em]all that is [F]in me a[G]dore [C]Him
[C]All that hath [**]life and breath [Em]come now with [F]praises be[G]fore [C]Him
[C]Let the a[F]men [C]sound from His [F]people a[G]gain
[G]Gladly for [Am]ever a[F]dore [C]Him
{end_of_verse}
